  </data>
  <data name="UIModel_InputMethod_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Choose the default input method (keyboard layout)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="UIModel_InputMethod_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>By default, Windows starts with the first input method of your language list. Choose an input method to start with it instead, whatever language is first in the list.</value>
